    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early settlers began establishing homesteads in Danwood during the 18th century, drawn by the fertile land and agricultural prosperity.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.city-usa.top/state-south-carolina-city-danwood"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cotton farming dominated the landscape of Danwood throughout the 19th century, when the area functioned as a rural agricultural hub.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.city-usa.top/state-south-carolina-city-danwood"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A small cavalry skirmish occurred near present-day Danwood during the Civil War, though the event left little lasting impact.",
